    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p>Last updated: May 2024</p>
    <p>By using IBS Go, you agree that our app and content are provided for personal educational tracking purposes only and do not constitute formal medical diagnosis or treatment.</p>
    <p><a href="/">&larr; Return to Home</a></p>
  </main>
</Layout>
